<title>MALAYSIA: Esso Malaysia 1996 net down 35.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Esso Malaysia 1996 net down 35.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	    58.13	vs	   89.92</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)   21.5	 vs	   33.3</p>
<p>    Turnover	   2,165.54	vs	1,767.50</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	66.68	vs	   91.07</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)  40.0	 vs	   40.0</p>
<p>NOTES - The full name of the company is Esso (Malaysia) Bhd. It is involved in oil and gas exploration and distributes petroleum products</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
